Recommends: pulseaudio-utils
Description: unofficial Shazam client for Linux, written in Rust
 SongRec is an open-source Shazam client for Linux that allows you to
 recognize music from various sources.
 .
 Features include:
  - Recognize audio from an arbitrary audio file
  - Recognize audio from the microphone
  - Usage from both GUI and command line (for file recognition)
  - History of recognized songs on the GUI, exportable to CSV
  - Continuous song detection from the microphone with input device
    selection
